OL,3,GNEWSAHastening mother's death 'utter
OL,4,Anonsense', jury told
OL,5,
OL,6,FGiving evidence at Oxford Crown Court
OL,7,Fon Friday, Mogford broke down in tears,
OL,8,Fsaying the exhumation of his mother had
OL,9,Fbeen "the worst thing".
